---
// The consent prompt for Google Analytics. Hidden until src/scripts/analytics.ts
// decides to show it: no saved choice yet, or "הגדרות עוגיות" in the footer.
//
// Small and non-blocking on purpose: a card, not a modal, no focus trap, no
// scrim, never takes focus on its own. "אישור" and "לא תודה" are the same size
// and sit side by side, so declining costs exactly as much as accepting.
---

<div
  id="consent-banner"
  class="consent-banner fixed inset-x-3 bottom-3 z-40 rounded-2xl border border-teal-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgb(41_37_36/0.3)] lg:inset-x-auto lg:start-6 lg:bottom-6 lg:w-[25rem]"
  role="region"
  aria-label="העדפות פרטיות"
  hidden
>
  <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
    אנחנו משתמשים ב־Google Analytics כדי להבין איך מגיעים לאתר ולשפר אותו. לא נאספים שמות או פרטי
    קשר.{' '}
    <a
      href="/privacy/#s8"
      class="inline-block py-1 font-medium text-teal-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-teal-800"
      >מידע נוסף</a
    >
  </p>
  <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2">
    <button type="button" data-consent="granted" class="btn-primary min-h-11 flex-1 !px-4 !py-2">
      אישור
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-consent="denied" class="btn-secondary min-h-11 flex-1 !px-4 !py-2">
      לא תודה
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .consent-banner {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(0.75rem);
    transition:
      opacity 220ms ease,
      transform 220ms ease;
  }
  .consent-banner[data-open='true'] {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }
  /* The home page's sticky call/WhatsApp bar is 53px tall plus the safe area:
     sit just above it on a phone instead of covering it. */
  @media (max-width: 63.999rem) {
    :global(body:has(#quick-contact-bar)) .consent-banner {
      bottom: calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + 3.75rem);
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .consent-banner {
      transition: none;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import '@scripts/analytics';
</script>
